      "body": {
        "en": "*Proszę iść prosto* is go straight on. *Proszę skręcić w lewo* is turn left, and *w prawo* is right. Where something is: *na rogu* (on the corner), *naprzeciwko* (opposite), *na górze* (at the top) and *na dole* (at the bottom)."
      }
